{"id":"dfaa54089e9b8340","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy.md","title":"High/Low Degree Hierarchy","display":"thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy — High/Low Degree Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy","aliases":["68-thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy — High/Low Degree Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[68-df-n-low-degree]]","[[68-df-n-high-degree]]","[[68-df-low-degree]]","[[68-df-high-degree]]","[[68-df-intermediate-degree]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"inclusions reviewed; strictness and existence proofs not checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-high-low-degree-hierarchy — High/Low Degree Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91c9057d86d1e5c9\" href=\"?note=91c9057d86d1e5c9\" title=\"68-df-n-low-degree\">68-df-n-low-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38307057883ddb78\" href=\"?note=38307057883ddb78\" title=\"68-df-n-high-degree\">68-df-n-high-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce0116f26f0a357\" href=\"?note=4ce0116f26f0a357\" title=\"68-df-low-degree\">68-df-low-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050030684fcc654f\" href=\"?note=050030684fcc654f\" title=\"68-df-high-degree\">68-df-high-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f4822140bfc0f9e\" href=\"?note=3f4822140bfc0f9e\" title=\"68-df-intermediate-degree\">68-df-intermediate-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"inclusions reviewed; strictness and existence proofs not checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n,\\mathrm{Low}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L_n,\\mathrm{Low}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91c9057d86d1e5c9\" href=\"?note=91c9057d86d1e5c9\" title=\"68-df-n-low-degree\">68-df-n-low-degree</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n,\\mathrm{High}_n\">\\(\\mathcal H_n,\\mathrm{High}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"38307057883ddb78\" href=\"?note=38307057883ddb78\" title=\"68-df-n-high-degree\">68-df-n-high-degree</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Low},\\mathrm{High}\">\\(\\mathrm{Low},\\mathrm{High}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ce0116f26f0a357\" href=\"?note=4ce0116f26f0a357\" title=\"68-df-low-degree\">68-df-low-degree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"050030684fcc654f\" href=\"?note=050030684fcc654f\" title=\"68-df-high-degree\">68-df-high-degree</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3f4822140bfc0f9e\" href=\"?note=3f4822140bfc0f9e\" title=\"68-df-intermediate-degree\">68-df-intermediate-degree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge1\\Longrightarrow(\\mathcal L_n\\subsetneq\\mathcal L_{n+1}\\land\\mathcal H_n\\subsetneq\\mathcal H_{n+1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge1\\Longrightarrow(\\mathcal L_n\\subsetneq\\mathcal L_{n+1}\\land\\mathcal H_n\\subsetneq\\mathcal H_{n+1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{Int}\\;\\mathrm{Low}(\\mathbf a),\\qquad\\exists\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{Int}\\;\\mathrm{High}(\\mathbf b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{Int}\\;\\mathrm{Low}(\\mathbf a),\\qquad\\exists\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{Int}\\;\\mathrm{High}(\\mathbf b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两种包含方向均为向上：若第 n 次跳跃已相等，再跳一次仍相等。旧 High_(n+1)⊊High_n 的方向反了。严格性与非零不完备 low/high r.e. 度的存在需要额外构造，未在给定 PDF 中定位，整项保留 pending。这里比较的 L_n、H_n 是度集合；Low_n、High_n 仍是谓词，避免谓词/集合混淆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-n-low-degree","status":"resolved","id":"91c9057d86d1e5c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-n-low-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-n-high-degree","status":"resolved","id":"38307057883ddb78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-n-high-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-low-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4ce0116f26f0a357","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor